                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="9" width="972" height="66"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">All rescue team members must be currently First Aid/CPR certified and must have a first aid kit on site. A backboard, basket stretcher, ropes, SCBA (if confirmed hazardous atmosphere) and similar equipment must be available if Fire Department rescue team has not been contacted and confirmed available to respond in a reasonable period of time. Note: Confined Space entry in trenches require a Confined Space Supervisor, Attendant, Entrant, and Rescue Team.</string>
                                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="14"/>
