                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="10" width="402" height="156.5"/>
                                                                <string key="text">Loose, cracked, split, bent or missing parts.
Labels in place and legible, load rating clear.
Ropes not frayed, extensions move freely.
Feet pads in place, rotate as designed.
All accessories approved by manufacturer.  
Any ladder with broken, missing or worn parts must be tagged and repaired by a qualified person or destroyed immediately.</string>
