                                                    <subviews>
                                                        <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="wordWrap" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="nFm-Iv-31n">
                                                            <rect key="frame" x="5" y="5" width="764" height="90"/>
                                                            <string key="text">Type of work or reason for entering the space: You and a team are assigned to clean out a round tank (approximate 8’ wide, 10’ tall and 40’ long) that was used to carry a herbicide solution to a canal system. The tank needs pressure washed with a solution, rinsed, and then pumped out. The water pumped out needs to be tested for PPM of REMEDYTM ULTRA Herbicide. Complete this rescue plan based on this scenario.   Then Fill out a Confined Space Assessment and Permit (make up any information you need to fill out the Permit and Rescue Plan Scenario completely.)</string>
                                                            <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="14"/>
                                                            <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                            <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                        </label>
